{"id":2584,"title":{"romaji":"Shigofumi","english":null,"native":null},"slug":"shigofumi","synopsis":"When someone dies, what should their final words be? Words that couldn't be said while still alive - of love, hate, hope, regret or perhaps words without any importance. These words are sent through letters called \"shigofumi\" from the recently deceased to the living. Mikawa Fumika is a mail carrier of these shigofumi, delivering them alongside staff and her partner Kanaka. However, there must be something more behind Fumika's silent exterior; shigofumi mail carriers are deceased humans with the same appearance they had just before death. Despite this, Fumika is still aging...\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2008,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:34","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 07:43:55","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":3420},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":3420},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":2996},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":5549},{"site":"ANN","externalId":8760},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":1707},{"site":"HIDIVE","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":5155,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/LrR2gs9eBb54yMTIGCljKmXuXkFlHcKQPEBq168O.png"},{"id":5156,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/hPncXq6moZHVaJjKNe65DG2iTDEArSyIIbUldFVa.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":34,"name":"J.C.Staff","slug":"jcstaff"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":3239,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":3239,"title":{"romaji":"Kotodama","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":3667,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":2426,"basename":"Shigofumi-OP1.webm","filename":"Shigofumi-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/Shigofumi-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":20706351,"resolution":720,"nc":false,"subbed":false,"lyrics":false,"overlap":"NONE","source":"WEB","tags":"","audio":{"id":2313,"basename":"Shigofumi-OP1.ogg","filename":"Shigofumi